title: The 1925 Presidential Election
subtitle: Germany's first direct Presidential Election, and hopefully not its last..
new-page: true
max-visits: 1
view-if: year = 1925 and month >= 4 and ebert_dead == 1
tags: event
on-arrival: {!
Q.liebknecht_multiplier = 0.8;
Q.marx_multiplier = 1.05;
Q.wirth_multiplier = 1; 
Q.hellpach_multiplier = 0.925;
Q.jarres_multiplier = 1;
Q.stresemann_multiplier = 1.05;
Q.ludendorff_multiplier = 0.35
Q.dnvp_multiplier = 1;
Q.nsdap_multiplier = 1;
if (Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Left" || Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Reformist" || Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Labor") {
Q.spd_multiplier = 0.9;
}
if (Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Center") {
Q.spd_multiplier = 0.95;
}
if (Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Nonfactional") {
Q.spd_multiplier = 0.975;
}
if (Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Neorevisionist") {
Q.spd_multiplier = 0.85;
}
!}

= The 1925 Presidential Election

It is expected that a wide variety of candidates will enter the race, though there has also been much discussion about joint candidates. Some in our Reformist wing argue that we should run a joint Weimar candidate. One suggestion which has been floated is Otto Gessler, to be backed by the SPD, DDP, Center Party, and DVP, but, with our party's left-wing is decisively opposed and the DVP reluctant, this has gone nowhere.
There are also those on our party's left who argue we should run a joint Socialist candidate with the [+ uspd_name +], though many others dismiss the idea as a pipedream.

As the incumbent Presidential party, many within the SPD and without expect us to run a candidate. Among our options are [? if president_party == "SPD" : our incumbent, President [+ president_fullname +], ?][? if chancellor_party == "SPD" : our Chancellor, [+ chancellor_fullname +], ?][? if vice_chancellor_party == "SPD" : our Vice-Chancellor [+ vice_chancellor_fullname +], ?][? if previous_spd_presidential_candidate != "Ebert" or (spd_previous_presidential_candidate == "Ebert" and ebert_dead == 0) : our candidate at the previous election, [+ spd_previous_presidential_candidate_fullname +], or ?] Paul Löbe, the newly elected President of the Reichstag, and Otto Braun, Minister-President of Prussia.

Which path should we take?

- @presidential_candidate_incumbent
- @presidential_candidate_previous
- @presidential_candidate_chancellor
- @presidential_candidate_vice_chancellor
- @presidential_candidate_braun
- @presidential_candidate_lobe_25
- @back_gessler_no: Back Otto Gessler of the DDP as a joint Republican candidate.
- @back_uspd_no: Back Karl Liebknecht of the [+ uspd_name +]
- @spd_presidential_menu: Perhaps we should consider a different candidate?

@spd_presidential_campaign
title: We choose [+ spd_presidential_candidate +] 
subtitle: The Campaign begins.
on-arrival: spd_campaign = 1

We have entered [+ spd_presidential_candidate_fullname +] into the race. Now it is time to campaign - without a healthy campaign, they may not even be assured the votes of the SPD.

- @the_other_candidates: Let us look at the candidates we face.

@the_other_candidates
on-arrival: {!
Q.uspd_campaign = 1;
Q.uspd_presidential_candidate = "Liebknecht";
Q.uspd_presidential_candidate_fullname = "Karl Liebknecht";
Q.ddp_campaign = 1; 
Q.ddp_presidential_candidate = "Hellpach";
Q.ddp_presidential_candidate_fullname = "Willy Hellpach";
Q.z_campaign = 1;
if (Q.chancellor == "Marx") {
Q.z_presidential_candidate = "Wirth";
Q.z_presidential_candidate_fullname = "Joseph Wirth";
}
else {
Q.z_presidential_candidate = "Marx";
Q.z_presidential_candidate_fullname = "Wilhelm Marx";
}
Q.bvp_campaign = 1;
Q.bvp_presidential_candidate = "Held";
Q.bvp_presidential_candidate_fullname = "Heinrich Held";
Q.dvp_campaign = 1;
if (Q.chancellor == "Jarres") {
Q.dvp_presidential_candidate = "Stresemann";
Q.dvp_presidential_candidate_fullname = "Gustav Stresemann";
}
else {
Q.dvp_presidential_candidate = "Jarres";
Q.dvp_presidential_candidate_fullname = "Karl Jarres";
}
Q.dnvp_campaign = 0;
Q.nsdap_campaign = 1;
Q.nsdap_presidential_candidate = "Ludendorff";
Q.nsdap_presidential_candidate_fullname = "Erich Ludendorff";
Q.gessler_campaign = 0;
Q.hindenburg_campaign = 0;
!}

The [+ uspd_name +] has entered into the race their leader [+ uspd_presidential_candidate_fullname +] , while the DVP and DNVP run [+ dvp_presidential_candidate_fullname +] as the "Reichsblock" candidate. The Center Party has run [+ z_presidential_candidate_fullname +], while the BVP, unwilling to commit to any of the main candidates, has run [+ bvp_presidential_candidate_fullname +]. The DDP is running [+ ddp_presidential_candidate_fullname +] and meanwhile, the recently reformed National Socialists are backing [+ nsdap_presidential_candidate_fullname +].

- @campaign_spd: Now, we must campaign.

@campaign_spd
on-arrival: spd_percent = 0.7

- @large_campaign: We will launch a large-scale campaign for [+ spd_presidential_candidate +].
- @small_campaign: We will launch a small-scale campaign for [+ spd_presidential_candidate +].
- @round1: Let the voting begin...

@large_campaign
subtitle: -2 resources
choose-if: resources >= 2
on-arrival: {!
resources -= 2;
if (Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Left" || Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Center" || Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Reformist" || Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Labor") {
Q.spd_multiplier += 0.1;
}
else if (Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Nonfactional") {
Q.spd_multiplier += 0.075;
}
else if (Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Neorevisionist") {
Q.spd_multiplier += 0.2;
}
!}
go-to: campaign_spd
max-visits: 1

We launch a large-scale campaign for [+ spd_presidential_candidate +] to ensure turnout from our party members.

@small_campaign
subtitle: -1 resource
choose-if: resources >= 1
go-to: campaign_spd
on-arrival: {!
resources -= 1; 
if (Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Left" || Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Center" || Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Reformist" || Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Labor") {
Q.spd_multiplier += 0.05;
}
else if (Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Nonfactional") {
Q.spd_multiplier += 0.05;
}
else if (Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Neorevisionist") {
Q.spd_multiplier += 0.1;
}
!}
max-visits: 1

We launch a small-scale campaign for [+ spd_presidential_candidate +] to try and ensure turnout from our party members.

@back_uspd_no
choose-if: never
unavailable-subtitle: As the larger Socialist Party, we are unwilling to stand aside.

@back_gessler_no
choose-if: never
unavailable-subtitle: Our Left will not tolerate this course of action. The DVP is uncomfortably noncommittal.

@round1
on-arrival: round25 += 1
go-to: election_algorithm
set-jump: post_election

