[? if dvp_campaign : [+ dvp_presidential_candidate +] - [+ dvp_votes_disp +]% ?]

[? if dnvp_campaign : Hergt - [+ dnvp_votes_disp +]% ?]

[? if hindenburg_campaign : Hindenburg - [+ hindenburg_votes_disp +]% ?]

[? if nsdap_campaign : Ludendorff - [+ nsdap_votes_disp +]% ?]

@hindenburg_wins
on-arrival: former_president = "Hindenburg"; president = "Hindenburg"; president_fullname = "Paul von Hindenburg"; president_party = "Independent"; pro_republic -= 5; nationalism += 5; workers_spd -= 6; unemployed_spd -= 6; workers_uspd += 4; unemployed_uspd += 4; west_relation -= 2; east_relation -= 2; dvp_relation -= 5; uspd_relation += 5; left_strength += 5; dvp_campaign = 0; z_campaign = 0; bvp_campaign = 0; uspd_campaign = 0; nsdap_campaign = 0; ddp_campaign = 0; spd_campaign = 0; z_support_spd = 0; ddp_support_spd = 0; bvp_support_hindenburg = 0; presidential_relation = 10;

Disaster strikes! Despite our best effort, Paul von Hindenburg has won the election with the backing of all the reactionary right organized under the **Reichsblock** behind him. Many in our party anticipate an immediate restructuring of Germany along authoritarian and aristocratic lines and though he seems, for now, to be following the constitution, we must be wary. Regardless, this signals a dark turn for German democracy. Who knows what Hindenburg may do in power?

@z_wins
on-arrival: president_party = "Z"; z_relation += 10; pro_republic += 5; nationalism -= 5; ddp_relation += 5; reformist_strength += 5; dvp_campaign = 0; z_campaign = 0; bvp_campaign = 0; uspd_campaign = 0; nsdap_campaign = 0; ddp_campaign = 0; spd_campaign = 0; z_support_spd = 0; ddp_support_spd = 0; bvp_support_hindenburg = 0; president_party = "Z"; z_relation += 10; pro_republic += 5; nationalism -= 5; ddp_relation += 5; reformist_strength += 5; dvp_campaign = 0; z_campaign = 0; bvp_campaign = 0; uspd_campaign = 0; nsdap_campaign = 0; ddp_campaign = 0; spd_campaign = 0; z_support_spd = 0; ddp_support_spd = 0; bvp_support_hindenburg = 0; president = z_presidential_candidate; president_fullname = z_presidential_candidate_fullname; presidential_relation = z_relation

[+ z_presidential_candidate_fullname +] has won the election with the backing of all the republican left organized under the **Volksblock** behind him. This is a victory for German democracy and the continued normalization of the republic.

@spd_wins
on-arrival: president_party = "SPD"; presidential_relation = 75; president = spd_presidential_candidate; president_fullname = spd_presidential_candidate_fullname; spd_president_faction = spd_presidential_candidate_faction; pro_republic += 8; socialism += 4; nationalism -= 2; dvp_relation -= 5; left_dissent -= 5; center_dissent -= 5; reformist_dissent -= 5; labor_dissent -= 5; workers_spd += 5 * (1 - dissent); new_middle_spd += 4 * (1 - dissent); unemployed_spd += 4 * (1 - dissent); rural_spd += 2 * (1 - dissent); dvp_campaign = 0; z_campaign = 0; bvp_campaign = 0; uspd_campaign = 0; nsdap_campaign = 0; ddp_campaign = 0; spd_campaign = 0; z_support_spd = 0; ddp_support_spd = 0; bvp_support_hindenburg = 0;

[+ spd_presidential_candidate +] has won the election! This has only been possible thanks to the backing of the [? if volksblock == 1 : **Volksblock**, the Center and Democratic parties ?][? if einheitsblock == 1 : **Einheitsblock**, the Socialist United Front ?]. Regardless, the continuation of Social Democratic rule over Germany is a significant victory, and the party is jubilant.

@ddp_wins
on-arrival: pro_republic += 2; president_party = "DDP"; socialism -= 5; left_dissent += 5; dvp_relation += 10; dvp_campaign = 0; ddp_campaign = 0; bvp_campaign = 0; uspd_campaign = 0; nsdap_campaign = 0; z_campaign = 0; spd_campaign = 0; ddp_support_spd = 0; ddp_support_spd = 0; bvp_support_hindenburg = 0; president = ddp_presidential_candidate; president_fullname = ddp_presidential_candidate_fullname; presidential_relation = ddp_relation; 

[? if ddp_presidential_candidate == "Gessler" :Otto Gessler has won the election as the candidate of the democratic parties, including the DVP. We have in this campaign pulled the DVP away from the DNVP and the right as a whole towards the center, but also created a hole on the left that the [+ uspd_name +] is eager to fill. ?][? if ddp_presidential_candidate != "Gessler" : [+ ddp_presidential_candidate_fullname +] has, despite a disappointing first round performance, managed to emerge from the second round victorious, at the head of the **Volksblock**. ?]

@uspd_wins
on-arrival: president = uspd_presidential_candidate; president_fullname = uspd_presidential_candidate_fullname; president_party = "USPD"; pro_republic -= 10; socialism += 10; workers_spd -= 5; unemployed_spd -= 5; workers_uspd += 4; unemployed_uspd += 4; west_relation -= 2; east_relation -= 2; dvp_relation -= 5; uspd_relation += 5; left_strength += 5; dvp_campaign = 0; z_campaign = 0; bvp_campaign = 0; uspd_campaign = 0; dnvp_campaign = 0; nsdap_campaign = 0; ddp_campaign = 0; spd_campaign = 0; z_support_spd = 0; ddp_support_spd = 0; bvp_support_hindenburg = 0; presidential_relation = uspd_relation;
go-to: civil_war

[+ uspd_presidential_candidate_fullname +] has won the Presidential Election, to the shock of the nation! Our party is split between delight, horror, and concern. The reactionary right, with the support of the appalled Bourgeois parties, have launched a coup, plunging the nation into Civil War.

@bvp_wins
on-arrival: president = bvp_presidential_candidate; president_fullname = bvp_presidential_candidate_fullname; president_party = "BVP"; dvp_campaign = 0; z_campaign = 0; bvp_campaign = 0; uspd_campaign = 0; nsdap_campaign = 0; ddp_campaign = 0; spd_campaign = 0; z_support_spd = 0; bvp_campaign = 0; ddp_support_spd = 0; bvp_support_hindenburg = 0; presidential_relation = bvp_relation;

Literally not even possible.

@dvp_wins
on-arrival: president = dvp_presidential_candidate; president_fullname = dvp_presidential_candidate_fullname; president_party = "DVP"; pro_republic -= 3; nationalism += 3; workers_spd -= 2; unemployed_spd -= 2; workers_uspd += 2; unemployed_uspd += 2; west_relation += 1; east_relation -= 1; dvp_relation -= 3; uspd_relation += 3; left_strength += 3; dvp_campaign = 0; z_campaign = 0; bvp_campaign = 0; uspd_campaign = 0; nsdap_campaign = 0; ddp_campaign = 0; spd_campaign = 0; z_support_spd = 0; dvp_campaign = 0; ddp_support_spd = 0; bvp_support_hindenburg = 0; presidential_relation = dvp_relation;

[+ dvp_presidential_candidate_fullname +] of the DVP has won the election at the head of the Reichsblock! This is a defeat for Social Democracy, and even the Republic for itself, but it will, and must, carry on.

@dnvp_wins
on-arrival: president = dnvp_presidential_candidate; president_fullname = dnvp_presidential_candidate_fullname; president_party = "DNVP"; pro_republic -= 7; nationalism += 7; workers_spd -= 5; unemployed_spd -= 5; workers_uspd += 4; unemployed_uspd += 4; west_relation -= 2; east_relation -= 2; dvp_relation -= 5; uspd_relation += 5; left_strength += 5; dvp_campaign = 0; z_campaign = 0; bvp_campaign = 0; uspd_campaign = 0; nsdap_campaign = 0; ddp_campaign = 0; spd_campaign = 0; z_support_spd = 0; dnvp_campaign = 0; ddp_support_spd = 0; bvp_support_hindenburg = 0; presidential_relation = dnvp_relation;

To our horror, [+ dnvp_presidential_candidate_fullname +] of the DNVP has won the Presidential Election! With the Presidency in the hands of an anti-monarchist and anti-republican, our young Republic may already be drawing to a close…

@nsdap_wins
on-arrival: president = nsdap_presidential_candidate; president_fullname = nsdap_presidential_candidate_fullname; chancellor = nsdap_presidential_candidate if presidential_powers != 1; chancellor_fullname = nsdap_presidential_candidate_fullname if presidential_powers != 1; president_party = "NSDAP"; chancellor_party = "NSDAP" if presidential_powers != 1; presidential_relation = 0; pro_republic -= 10; nationalism += 10; workers_spd -= 10; unemployed_spd -= 10; workers_uspd += 10; unemployed_uspd += 10; west_relation -= 4; east_relation -= 4; dvp_relation -= 5; uspd_relation += 15; left_strength += 15; dvp_campaign = 0; z_campaign = 0; bvp_campaign = 0; uspd_campaign = 0; nsdap_campaign = 0; ddp_campaign = 0; spd_campaign = 0; z_support_spd = 0; dnvp_campaign = 0; ddp_support_spd = 0; bvp_support_hindenburg = 0;

To our horror, [+ nsdap_presidential_candidate_fullname +] of the NSDAP has won the Presidential Election! With him wasting no time in consolidating power, the twilight of the Republic is upon us…

- @nsdap_victory: What do we do now?
- @nsdap_referendum: What do we do now?
- @nsdap_stall: What do we do now?

@nsdap_victory
view-if: presidential_powers != 1
go-to: hitler_takes_power

@nsdap_referendum
view-if: presidential_powers == 1 and sa_banned != 1
on-arrival: pro_republic -= 5; workers_nsdap += 3; unemployed_nsdap += 3; new_middle_nsdap += 3; old_middle_nsdap += 3; rural_nsdap += 3
go-to: hitler_constitution

@nsdap_stall
view-if: presidential_powers == 1 and sa_banned == 1
on-arrival: judicial_reform -= 1 if judicial_reform >= 1; interior_police_loyalty -= 0.05; pro_republic -= 10; workers_nsdap += 5; unemployed_nsdap += 5; new_middle_nsdap += 5; old_middle_nsdap += 5; rural_nsdap += 5

Thanks to our reforms weakening the presidency's powers and the banning of the SA, [+ nsdap_presidential_candidate +] is unable to immediately consolidate power as he would like to. He has however taken full advantage of his new position for campaigning, attempting to spread the Nazi message to all German citizens in preparation for the next election.

@no_majority_round1
go-to: spd_consolidation if spd_campaign

As expected, there is no majority in the first round of voting.

@spd_consolidation
on-arrival: ddp_campaign = 0;
go-to: spd2_menu

[+ spd_presidential_candidate +] has landed [? if spd_votes_disp > spd_r : a stunning ?] [+ spd_votes_disp +]%, easily ahead of all other parties in the Weimar Coalition. Nonetheless, experience from the elections of the German Empire shows that bourgeois voters rarely vote social democrats in runoffs - it may be better to endorse [+ z_presidential_candidate_fullname +] in the second round. [? if spd_prussia == 0 : This option is particularly worth considering as the Z have promised to vote Otto Braun back in as Minister-President of Prussia. ?] The [+ uspd_name +], meanwhile, calls for an Einheitsblock of the Marxist parties against the Bourgeoise. Inevitably, the two are mutually exclusive, and so we must make our decision with the weight of the Republic on our backs.

Meanwhile, the **Reichsblock** of the right begins to desperately search for a candidate able to mobilize higher turnout from their camp. Whether or not they will succeed remains to be seen.

@spd2_menu

- @volksblock: We will enter negotiations to run a single Volksblock candidate alongside the other Weimar parties.
- @einheitsblock: We will enter negotiations to run a single Einheitsblock candidate with the [+ uspd_name +].

@volksblock

We have chosen to run a Volksblock candidate with the [+ ddp_name +] and Z. We must now decide who that will be…

- @convince_ddp: Convince the DDP to back [+ spd_presidential_candidate +] as the candidate of the **Volksblock**.
- @convince_z: Convince the Center Party to back [+ spd_presidential_candidate +] as the candidate of the **Volksblock**.
- @back_z: Drop out and endorse [+ z_presidential_candidate_fullname +] as the candidate of the **Volksblock**.
- @back_ddp: Convince the Center Party to back [+ ddp_presidential_candidate +] as the candidate of the **Volksblock**.
- @back_gessler: Convince the Center Party to back Otto Gessler of the DDP as the candidate of the **Volksblock**.
- @einheitsblock: Perhaps negotiations for an Einheitsblock with the [+ uspd_name +] might prove more productive…
- @campaign_round_two: [? if not ddp_support_spd or not z_support_spd : There is no use to further negotiations. ?][? if ddp_support_spd and z_support_spd : All negotiations are concluded. ?] Let us return to the campaign.

@convince_ddp
view-if: spd_campaign
choose-if: (ddp_relation >= 50 and reformist_campaign == 1) or (ddp_relation >= 60 and reformist_campaign == 0 and left_campaign == 0)
unavailable-subtitle: The DDP is unwilling to back [+ spd_presidential_candidate +].
on-arrival: ddp_support_spd = 1; ddp_support_z = 0
max-visits: 1
go-to: volksblock

We have convinced the DDP to endorse [+ spd_presidential_candidate +]!

@convince_z
view-if: spd_campaign
choose-if: (z_relation >= 55 and reformist_campaign == 1) or (z_relation >= 60 and reformist_campaign == 0 and left_campaign == 0)
unavailable-subtitle: The Center Party is unwilling to back [+ spd_presidential_candidate +].
max-visits: 1

The Center Party is willing to be convinced; how do we convince them?

- @resources_z: Front the resources for a joint campaign.
- @relations_z: Use our relations.
- @volksblock: Forget the Center Party.

@resources_z
subtitle: -1 resource
choose-if: resources >= 1
on-arrival: z_relation += 5; resources -= 1; left_dissent += 2; z_campaign = 0; z_support_spd = 1; bvp_support_hindenburg = 1
go-to: volksblock

With our resources, the Center Party has agreed to back [+ spd_presidential_candidate +]. The Bavarian People's Party however, with about 3% of the vote behind it, has not, and turns to Hindenburg.

@relations_z
subtitle: We require good relations.
choose-if: z_relation >= 65
on-arrival: z_relation -= 5; z_campaign = 0; z_support_spd = 1; bvp_support_hindenburg = 1
go-to: volksblock

Using our relations to win them over, the Center Party has agreed to back [+ spd_presidential_candidate +]. The Bavarian People's Party however, with about 3% of the vote behind it, has not, and turns to Hindenburg.

@einheitsblock

We have chosen to run an Einheitsblock candidate with the [+ uspd_name +]. We must now decide who that will be…

- @convince_uspd: Convince the [+ uspd_name +] to back [+ spd_presidential_candidate +] as the candidate of the **Einheitsblock**.
- @back_liebknecht: Drop out and endorse Karl Liebknecht as the candidate of the **Einheitsblock**.
- @volksblock: Perhaps negotiations for a Volksblock with the Weimar parties might prove more successful…
- @campaign_round_two: There is no use to further negotiations. Let us return to the campaign.

@convince_uspd
view-if: spd_campaign
choose-if: (uspd_relation >= 35 and left_campaign == 1) or (uspd_relation >= 55 and left_campaign == 0 and reformist_campaign == 0)
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ uspd_name +] is unwilling to back [+ spd_presidential_candidate +].
on-arrival: uspd_support_spd = 1; uspd_campaign = 0
max-visits: 1
go-to: campaign_round_two

We have successfully convinced the [+ uspd_name +] to back us as the candidate of the **Einheitsblock**! Now all that remains is to win.

@back_liebknecht
view-if: uspd_campaign and not spd_support_liebknecht
on-arrival: ddp_support_spd = 0; ddp_support_z = 1; spd_support_liebknecht = 1; left_dissent -= 5; workers_spd += 1; spd_campaign = 0; backed_liebknecht = 1; z_relation -= 15; uspd_relation += 15
go-to: campaign_round_two

We have dropped out and endorsed [+ uspd_presidential_cabinet_fullname +] as the candidate of the **Einheitsblock**. In return, we have received verbal guarantees of [+ uspd_name +] support across the various Landtags.

@back_z
view-if: z_campaign and not spd_support_z and not spd_support_ddp
on-arrival: spd_prussia = 1; ddp_support_spd = 0; ddp_support_z = 1; spd_support_z = 1; left_dissent += 5; workers_spd -= 1; spd_campaign = 0; backed_z = 1; uspd_relation -= 15; z_relation += 15
go-to: campaign_round_two

We have dropped out and endorsed [+ z_presidential_candidate_fullname +], who is now the candidate of the **Volksblock**.

@back_ddp
view-if: not spd_support_ddp and not spd_support_z
on-arrival: spd_prussia = 1; ddp_campaign = 1; z_campaign = 0; z_support_spd = 0; z_support_ddp = 1; spd_support_ddp = 1; left_dissent += 5; workers_spd -= 1; spd_campaign = 0; backed_ddp = 1; uspd_relation -= 15; z_relation += 5; ddp_relation += 15;
go-to: campaign_round_two

After long negotiations, both we and the Zentrum have dropped out and endorsed [+ ddp_presidential_candidate_fullname +] of the [+ ddp_name +], who is now the candidate of the **Volksblock**.

@back_gessler
view-if: not spd_support_ddp and not spd_support_z and chancellor != "Gessler"
subtitle: Gessler poses a clear threat to the DVP's chances, but our own party's left-wing will likely revolt.
choose-if: left_strength < reformist_strength
on-arrival: ddp_presidential_candidate = "Gessler"; ddp_campaign = 1; spd_campaign = 0; z_campaign = 0; resources -= 1; left_dissent += 20; workers_spd -= 6; workers_uspd += 6; unemployed_spd -= 6; unemployed_uspd += 6; old_middle_dvp -= 5; rural_dvp -= 5; spd_support_ddp = 1; z_support_ddp = 1;
go-to: campaign_round_two

We have managed to engineer a Gessler coalition. The left is understandably outraged, and the Spartacist campaign is bolstered. Nonetheless, we are now well positioned to win from the center.

@campaign_round_two
on-arrival: {!
Q.bvp_campaign = 0; 
Q.dvp_campaign = 0; 
Q.nsdap_campaign = 0; 
Q.dvp_support_hindenburg = 1; 
Q.hindenburg_campaign = 1; 
Q.nationalism += 5;
if (z_relation < 55 && spd_support_z) {
Q.bvp_support_hindenburg = 1
}
else if (z_relation > 65 || not spd_support_z) {
Q.bvp_support_z = 1;
}
if (Q.uspd_support_spd == 1 ZZ Q.spd_support_uspd == 1) {
Q.hindenburg_multiplier = 1.15;
Q.wirth_multiplier = 0.9;
Q.marx_multiplier = 0.8;
}
if (Q.uspd_support_spd == 1 && Q.spd_campaign == 1 && (Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Left" || Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Nonfactional")) {
Q.spd_multiplier = 0.9;
}
else if (Q.uspd_support_spd == 1 && Q.spd_campaign == 1 && (Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Center" || Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Labor")) {
Q.spd_multiplier = 0.85;
}
else if (Q.uspd_support_spd == 1 && Q.spd_campaign == 1 && Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Neorevisionist") {
Q.spd_multiplier = 0.65;
}
if ((Q.ddp_support_spd == 1 or Q.z_support_spd == 1) && Q.spd_campaign == 1 && (Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Reformist" || Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Nonfactional")) {
Q.spd_multiplier = 0.9;
}
if ((Q.ddp_support_spd == 1 or Q.z_support_spd == 1) && Q.spd_campaign == 1 && (Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Center" || Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Labor")) {
Q.spd_multiplier = 0.85;
}
if ((Q.ddp_support_spd == 1 or Q.z_support_spd == 1) && Q.spd_campaign == 1 && Q.spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Neorevisionist") {
Q.spd_multiplier = 0.65;
}
if (Q.spd_support_uspd == 1) {
Q.liebknecht_multiplier = 0.75;
}
if (Q.spd_support_z) {
Q.marx_multiplier = 0.95;	
Q.wirth_multiplier = 0.975;
}
if (Q.spd_support_ddp) {
Q.hellpach_multiplier = 0.875;
Q.gessler_multiplier = 0.8;
}
!}

Just as we conclude our own decisions with regard to the presidential campaign, we receive news of the entry of Paul von Hindenburg into the race. Considered by the right-wing a war hero, Paul von Hindenburg was a Field Marshal in the German Empire and managed to win the Battle of Tannenberg against Russia. To us, however, he is a reactionary junker and one of the primary peddlers of the stab-in-the-back myth, the same which recently cost Friedrich Ebert his life. 

He has received the backing of the DVP, the DNVP[? if bvp_support_hindenburg :, the BVP?], the NSDAP, and the various minor parties of the center-right. A victory for him could mean the end of democracy as we know it.

- @rally_2: Rally for [? if spd_campaign == 1 : [+ spd_presidential_candidate +] ?][? if spd_support_ddp == 1 : [+ ddp_presidential_candidate +] ?][? if spd_support_z == 1 : [+ z_presidential_candidate +] ?][? if spd_support_uspd == 1 : [+ uspd_presidential_candidate +] ?]!
- @campaign_2: Campaign for [? if spd_campaign == 1 : [+ spd_presidential_candidate +] ?][? if spd_support_ddp == 1 : [+ ddp_presidential_candidate +] ?][? if spd_support_z == 1 : [+ z_presidential_candidate +] ?][? if spd_support_uspd == 1 : [+ uspd_presidential_candidate +] ?]!
- @convince_dvp_abstain_success: Convince the DVP to abstain.
- @democracy_rally: Rally for democracy, and against monarchism.
- @donate_uspd: Provide more campaign resources for the left to spend.
- @donate_z: Provide more campaign resources for the right to spend.
- @attack_z_m: Attempt to win over sympathetic progressives by attacking [+ z_presidential_candidate +].
- @attack_uspd_m: Attempt to win back our left-wing, and attack Liebknecht.
- @round1: Let the voting begin...

@convince_dvp_abstain_success
view-if: ddp_presidential_candidate == "Gessler" and ddp_campaign
choose-if: resources >= 2
subtitle: -2 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 2; dvp_abstain = 1; old_middle_dvp -= 4; new_middle_dvp -= 3; rural_dvp -= 4; dvp_relation -= 10; left_dissent += 10; workers_spd -= 3; unemployed_spd -= 3; left_strength += 5
go-to: campaign_round_two

We try to convince the DVP to abstain, or even back the Gessler campaign, causing immense debate within the DVP. Many on the right may vote Hindenburg anyway. In the end, in the name of party unity, it is decided the DVP will abstain in the election.

@attack_z_m
view-if: spd_support_uspd or uspd_support_spd
subtitle: -1 resource - this may backfire!
go-to: campaign_round_two
choose-if: resources >= 1
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
resources -= 1; 
z_relation -= 5; 
ddp_relation -= 5; 
workers_uspd += 2; 
unemployed_uspd += 2; 
left_dissent -= 5; 
left_strength -= 5; 
nationalism += 2; 
pro_republic -= 2;
if (uspd_support_spd || spd_presidential_candidate_faction != "Neorevisionist" || spd_presidential_candidate_faction != "Nonfactional") {
spd_multiplier += 0.05
}
else if (uspd_support_spd || spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Nonfactional") {
spd_multiplier += 0.025
}
else if (uspd_support_spd || spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Neorevisionist") {
spd_multiplier += 0.05
}
else if (spd_support_uspd) {
liebknecht_multiplier += 0.05
}
!}

We attack [+ z_presidential_candidate +] for every fault we can find, and make concessions to our reformist wing.

@democracy_rally
subtitle: -1 resource
choose-if: resources >= 1
on-arrival: {!
resources -= 1; 
pro_republic += 6; 
nationalism -= 3; 
workers_dnvp -= 2; 
new_middle_dnvp -= 2; 
left_dissent -= 2;
if (uspd_support_spd and spd_presidential_candidate_faction != "Neorevisionist" and spd_presidential_candidate_faction != "Nonfactional") {
spd_multiplier += 0.05
}
else if (uspd_support_spd and spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Nonfactional") {
spd_multiplier += 0.025
}
else if (uspd_support_spd and spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Neorevisionist") {
spd_multiplier += 0.05
}
if (spd_support_uspd) {
liebknecht_multiplier += 0.05
}
if ((Q.ddp_support_spd == 1 or z_support_spd == 1) and spd_presidential_candidate_faction != "Neorevisionist" and spd_presidential_candidate_faction != "Nonfactional") {
spd_multiplier += 0.05
}
else if ((Q.ddp_support_spd == 1 or z_support_spd == 1) and spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Nonfactional") {
spd_multiplier += 0.025
}
else if ((Q.ddp_support_spd == 1 or z_support_spd == 1) and spd_presidential_candidate_faction == "Neorevisionist") {
spd_multiplier += 0.05
}
if (spd_support_z) {
marx_multiplier += 0.05
wirth_multiplier += 0.05
}
if (spd_support_z) {
hellpach_multiplier += 0.05
gessler_multiplier += 0.05
}
!}
go-to: campaign_round_two
