@presidential_candidate_incumbent
title: Run President [+ president +], the incumbent.
subtitle: The incumbency may give us an advantage over fielding a new candidate.
view-if: president_party == "SPD"
on-arrival: spd_presidential_candidate = president; spd_presidential_candidate_fullname = president_fullname; spd_presidential_candidate_faction = spd_president_faction

We have made the incumbent President [+ spd_presidential_candidate +] our candidate for the upcoming Presidential elections.

- @spd_presidential_campaign: Now onto the campaign

@presidential_candidate_previous
title: Run [+ spd_presidential_candidate +], our candidate at the last election.
subtitle: Their high profile from the previous campaign may give us an advantage.
view-if: (previous_spd_presidential_candidate != president) and (previous_spd_presidential_candidate != chancellor) and (previous_spd_presidential_candidate != "Vacant")
on-arrival: spd_presidential_candidate = previous_spd_presidential_candidate; spd_presidential_candidate_fullname = previous_spd_presidential_candidate_fullname; spd_presidential_candidate_faction = previous_spd_presidential_candidate_faction

- @spd_presidential_campaign: Now onto the campaign
    
@presidential_candidate_chancellor
