@presidential_candidate_lobe_25
title: Run Paul Löbe, the President of the Reichstag [? if spd_coleader_1 == "Löbe" or spd_coleader_2 == "Löbe" or spd_coleader_3 == "Löbe" : and our Co-leader ?][? if left_leader == "Löbe" : and our Left faction leader ?][? if center_leader == "Löbe" : and our Center faction leader ?][? if labor_leader == "Löbe" : and our Labor faction leader ?][? if reformist_leader == "Löbe" : and our Reformist faction leader ?][? if neorevisionist_leader == "Löbe" : and our Neorevisionist faction leader ?].
